==Location and Uses==
Blueshell Escargots are a type of [[Roasted Food]], resulting from [[Hearty Blueshell Snail]]s that have made contact with [[Fire]] or a [[Scorching Climate]].<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 295}}</ref> Blueshell Escargots are known for having a trademark bitter taste.<ref name="Inventory"/> [[Link]] can restore four and a half [[Heart]]s to his [[Life Gauge]] by eating Blueshell Escargot.

